    dcterms:title "O4SE Data Management Module"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "v1.0.1 owner-controlled remediation: added owl:versionIRI + BP-D24 metadata; repaired DRIFT-19 datatype ranges. NOTE: the original 1.0.0 Protege draft carried no recorded creation date (the SD-7 provenance gap); dcterms:created reflects this first provenanced release. SWEBOK/CMMI and general SE literature are the concept sources; book is dcterms:source, not owner."@en,
        "v1.0.2: Tier-1 definition pass — 100 class skos:definition added, grounded in existing rdfs:comment (internal authority). Tier-2 (external seminal sources) pending."@en ;
